  "description": "Nalix.Codec is a high-performance data transformation and framing engine for the Nalix ecosystem. It provides a unified pipeline for serialization, stream compression (LZ4), and AEAD cryptography. \nDesigned for .NET 10, it enables zero-allocation object-to-packet transformation, secure handshake protocols, and robust data framing, ensuring maximum throughput and end-to-end data integrity.",
  "iconFile": "nalix.png",
  "id": "Nalix.Codec",
  "isPrerelease": false,
